  "bodyHash": "cd65b7828fe3ab77",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Это <strong>Forge</strong> версия мода! Получить версию для Fabric можно здесь: <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric</a></span></p>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3>Настраиваемые модели игроков</h3>\n<p>Создайте свой собственный аватар с помощью редактора.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/337/167/2021-01-30_12.png\" alt=\"Создание шляпы в редакторе\" width=\"960\" height=\"509\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Модели необходимо экспортировать, чтобы они отображались в мире. <a href=\"https://github.com/tom5454/CustomPlayerModels/wiki/Exporting\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/tom5454/CustomPlayerModels/wiki/Exporting</a></span><br>Модели хранятся в неиспользуемом пространстве вашей скина Minecraft или как Gist на GitHub.</p>\n<p>Загрузите экспортированный файл изображения в качестве своего скина, чтобы загрузить пользовательскую модель.</p>\n<p>Просматривайте загруженные модели на <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcpmmodels.tom5454.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">сайте моделей</a>. &nbsp;</p>\n<p>Дополнительные части могут иметь пользовательские текстуры, можно использовать скины более высокого разрешения <span style=\"font-size:10px\">(скин Стива из <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/soartex-fanver-vanilla\" rel=\"nofollow\">Soartex Fanver - Vanilla</a>)</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><br></span></p>\n<p>Отдельные части стандартной модели игрока можно скрыть или переместить.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/337/171/cpm_examples.png\" alt=\"Примеры\" width=\"960\" height=\"509\"></p>\n<p>Вы можете даже заставить части вашего скина «светиться», как светящийся кальмар.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/337/173/2021-01-30_12.png\" alt=\"Свечение\" width=\"320\" height=\"272\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Сервер Discord: </span><a style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:Whitney, &amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-decoration:none;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:rgba(4, 4, 5, 0.07)\" href=\"https://discord.gg/mKyXdEsMZD\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong>https://discord.gg/mKyXdEsMZD</strong></span></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Плагин для серверов Bukkit/Spigot для смены скинов в игре (необязательно): <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/bukkit-plugins/custom-player-models-bukkit\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/bukkit-plugins/custom-player-models-bukkit</a></span></p>\n<h3>Скачивания по версиям Minecraft и загрузчиков:</h3>\n<p>1.21.1 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.21.1&gameVersionTypeId=6\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.21.1&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=1.21.1&gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.20.6 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.20.6&gameVersionTypeId=6\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.20.6&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=1.20.6&gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.20.4 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.20.4&gameVersionTypeId=6\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.20.4&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=1.20.4&gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=1.20.4&gameVersionTypeId=5\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quilt</a><br>1.20.2 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.20.2&gameVersionTypeId=6\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.20.2&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=1.20.2&gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.20.1 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.20.1&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=1.20.1&gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=1.20.1&gameVersionTypeId=5\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quilt</a><br>1.19.4 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.19.4&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=1.19.4&gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.19.3 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.19.3&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=1.19.3&gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.19.2 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.19.2&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=1.19.2&gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.18.2 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.18.2&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=1.18.2&gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.17.1 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.17.1&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=1.17.1&gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.16.5 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.16.5&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=1.16.5&gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.15.2 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.15.2&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=1.15.2&gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.14.4 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.14.4&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=1.14.4&gameVersionTypeId=4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a><br>1.12.2 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.12.2&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a><br>1.10.2 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.10.2&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a><br>1.8.9 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.8.9&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a><br>1.7.10 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.7.10&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a><br>1.6.4 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.6.4&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a><br>1.5.2 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.5.2&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a><br>1.4.7 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.4.7&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a><br>1.2.5 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models/files?version=1.2.5&gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a></p>\n<p>Beta 1.7.3 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-player-models-fabric/files?version=Beta 1.7.3&gameVersionTypeId=17\" rel=\"nofollow\">Babric и Better Than Adventure</a></p>",
